# ==============================================================================
# runtime and logs
# ==============================================================================

*.log
*.pid
# Process/daemon lock files. Dependency lockfiles share the extension but must be
# committed -- `uv sync --locked`, `composer install`, and friends need them, and
# their absence tends to show up as a broken CI or container build rather than as
# an obviously missing file.
*.lock
!uv.lock
!poetry.lock
!pdm.lock
!Cargo.lock
!composer.lock
!Gemfile.lock
!yarn.lock
!bun.lock
!flake.lock
.cache/
